  ("Handy examples", "<p>Remove blank pages and adverts from a scanned booklet, delete the terms and conditions pages before sending a bill, pull out only the page of a long bank statement that shows a single transaction, or send just the signed page of a contract. The original file is never changed, so you can try again at any time.</p>"),
